description=Improvised weapons with their own models, made from household things that otherwise go unused. No skill, nothing to learn, little more than duct tape; they are fragile, and when one breaks you get the useful part back. Hockey Stick Cleaver (a meat cleaver on an ice hockey stick, Axe), Bread Knife Glaive (a bread knife on a long handle, broom or mop, Long Blade), Cutlery Mace (forks and butter knives round a handle or rolling pin, Short Blunt), Lock in a Sock (a padlock in a long sock, made in the hands with no tools) and Sock Flail (the same on a small handle). In development.
